OverTheWire Bandit: Level 12 → 13

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 13.
The password is stored in a file that has been repeatedly compressed using different formats.

Steps
Log in as bandit12:
ssh bandit12@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Create a working directory and copy the file:
mkdir /tmp/bandit12
cp data.txt /tmp/bandit12
cd /tmp/bandit12
Convert the hex dump back to binary:
xxd -r data.txt > data
Repeatedly identify and extract the file using appropriate tools (file, tar, gzip, bzip2) until the final text file is obtained:
file data
Read the final extracted file:
cat <final-file>

Result
The final output contains the password for Bandit Level 13.

